              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino-naca obino kobo ni, “Nen ba, man en Obaŋawa ame obedo kuro me larowa, Man en Rwot ame obedo kuro; olel wunu doŋ i yomcuny pi kite a en olarowa kede.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
